      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Hires character portrait\n\n1. **Pick a character**: click the name on **Character Select**. Characters come from **+ Character** in Model Librarian for Chrome on a Danbooru, Gelbooru, Safebooru or e621 post, or from Model Librarian Gallery.\n2. **Run.** The picture is made at 832×1216, enlarged with 4x-AnimeSharp, brought down to 1.5× (1248×1824) and sampled again at 0.4 denoise for the detail. The seed is fixed: change it for another picture, and only the hires pass runs again when you change its settings.\n3. **Gallery Info** saves it in *Character portraits*, in a folder for each character, tagged with the character.\n\n**Missing its models?** Model Librarian shows a notice when the workflow opens: **Workflow → Find all sources → Download** fetches Illustrious XL v2.0 (6.9 GB) and 4x-AnimeSharp (33 MB) from HuggingFace, SHA256-verified.\n"
      ],
      "title": "How to use it",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
